WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.360
John: Hey, I've got an idea. Hank: What's your idea?

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.100
J: I want you to say "Good morning, John" and then I'll be like "Good morning!"

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.260
H: Okay, that-we've had that idea before. J: I know, it's still funny though.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.820
H: Good morning, John! J: Good morning!

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.060
J: Ahh! We're together!

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.380
("Song for the Painfully Indie" by Tom Milsom plays)

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:53.000
(song ends)

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:57.480
J: I wouldn't do that for a thousand dollars. Katherine: I don't think I would enjoy that either.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.300
H: Punishment! K: That's a little too high.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.900
J: Yeah, that's not a funny punishment.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.680
H: Punishment! We'll make you do the Frog Hopper!

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:04.480
J: Not gonna do it. H: It'd be all over the place.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.880
J: I literally wouldn't do that for a thousand dollars. I might not do it for ten thousand dollars.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.820
I don't want to do that at all.

